  "description": "Roslyn analyzers for a no-comments code style: DLZ0001 bans line/block comments, DLZ0002 allows doc comments only on public/protected members, DLZ0003 caps a doc comment at 3 lines of summary/param/returns, DLZ0004 requires Method_Scenario_Expected test names, DLZ0005 reports types in Services/Helpers/Utils/Utilities/Common namespaces, DLZ0006-DLZ0015 enforce the house patterns (IHttpClientFactory, IOptions, declared authorization, IMemoryCache, justified suppressions, architecture style, records for DTOs/commands/events, services injected not constructed, RESTful routes, only repositories touch the database), DLZ0016 bans LINQ query syntax, DLZ0017 orders members by access per kind, DLZ0018 caps a file at 300 raw lines with a shrink-only file-size-baseline.txt; DLZ0016 and DLZ0017 take shrink-only linq-syntax-baseline.txt and member-order-baseline.txt, DLZ0019 reports a baseline entry above the actual count. Brings Meziantou.Analyzer, Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers and SonarAnalyzer.CSharp as warnings that never fail a TreatWarningsAsErrors build. Ships Meziantou.Analyzer, Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers and SonarAnalyzer.CSharp as warnings; pack IDs and DLZ0001-DLZ0005, DLZ0012, DLZ0013, DLZ0014-DLZ0019 are in WarningsNotAsErrors.",
